Subject: [PATCH] release: check required QML module declarations

Retain the normal static QML module metadata imported by QtQml and validate selected module imports and qmldir dependencies. Record disabled plugin sources separately from required imports and omit Qt Designer data from the compact runtime profile.

The corrected normal-root static plan passes with 3758 files and 293944222 expanded bytes. Record the preceding successful host SquashFS result separately from the still unqualified runtime and corrected-image rebuild.

