+## Measured host build
+
+The first real normal-input build at source commit `5a93e04` produced a
+109,719,552-byte gzip SquashFS file (104.64 MiB), below the unchanged 128 MiB
+limit. Its filesystem superblock reports 109,715,658 bytes and 256 KiB blocks.
+The selected root was 293,882,327 expanded bytes; tablet-home ownership was
+1000, and the normal Labwc/cursor binaries were root-owned with mode 0755.
+
+That image establishes compressor and ownership results for the preceding
+selection. A subsequent static import audit added the normal `QML` module
+metadata required by QtQml's declarations; the corrected selection needs a
+fresh image. No mount/session lifecycle, GUI or device result is established
+by either the host size measurement or static import checks.
+
+## Memory bounds
+
 - Selected regular files: at most 384 MiB and 25,000 files.
 - Gzip SquashFS image: at most 128 MiB, 256 KiB blocks, one build worker.
 - Writable overlay: default 64 MiB, configurable only between 16 and 128 MiB.
